### Avoid item-specific provisional extraction (2/2)

**Severity:** `high`

A failed `FileType` lookup creates a path-specific fallback. Without this guard, it can extract the original item's thumbnail under the shared type-icon request, so an item-specific icon is displayed as a provisional type icon. Apply together with part 1 so neither the alias nor extraction poisons other extension requests.

```suggestion
        if (locatedIcon.Request.LocationMode == ShellItemIconLocationMode.FileType)
        {
            return ValueTask.FromResult(ShellIconExtractionResult.Empty());
        }

        return ExtractStreamAsync(locatedIcon.Request);
```
